T:Bacon Flitch. or.. WCD3/6.008, The
A: England; London
O:
T:Trip to Dunmow. WCD3/6.008, The
M:2/4
L:1/8
Z:vmp.Peter Dunk.2011.from a transcription by Paul Dennant
B:John Walsh Jr. The Compleat Country Dancing Master.Vol 6 1756
N:The Dunmow Flitch Trials exist to award a flitch of bacon to
N:married couples from anywhere in the world, if they can
N:satisfy the Judge and Jury of 6 maidens and 6 bachelors that
N:in 'twelvemonth and a day', they have 'not wisht themselves
N:unmarried again'.
